    "message": "Check the geometry config cache on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe cache tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder\n(20 evacuees, one day, seed 2026) instead of the Scenario the UI makes.\nThey now use the shared generated_scenario fixture (#88).\n\nThe three unit tests of the per-phase cache join the other\ngeometry_overlay unit tests; the tick-phase test stays here as the\nintegration test. Their shared validation counter becomes the\ncount_validations fixture in tests/conftest.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
